\v 7 \w When my soul| strong="H5315" \w* [fainted]{strong=“H5848” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8692”} [within me I remembered]{strong=“H2142” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc*: \w and my prayer| strong="H8605" \w* [came in]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto thee, into thine holy]{strong=“H6944”} \w temple| strong="H1964" \w*. 
