\c 3
\p 
\v 1 \w And the word| strong="H1697" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* \w came unto Jonah| strong="H3124" \w* \w the second| strong="H8145" \w* [time, saying]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, 
